title: mf sync
tags: [[CLI command]] Sync
kind: reference
summary: Cross-repo synchronisation: plan, review, run, and the links between two repositories.

The sync commands, each naming the two repositories — by name or uuid, in either
order ([[Sync]]). The usual round is `plan`, `show`, `run` ([[Syncing two repositories]]); `status`, `link` and `unlink` read and adjust the links.
